# M11 "Künye", flow "stats_rich" run 1 (needs the PostgreSQL test database): creates the Aydor warrior
# "Kunyeli" and quits at the character list. run-ui-flows.ps1 then raises it to level 10 (27 unspent
# points) and gives it a Bekçi Kalkanı (Dayanıklılık +3) with vo_admin, in the flow's own vo_it_*
# schema of vedatonline_test, before run 2 (stats_rich.voscript) enters the world.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m11_rich
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Kunyeli
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
quit
